{
 "name": "Boats on lab_harbor: alice on the quay's edge presses E by the moored dinghy and takes the driver's seat (seat 0, at the outboard); bob then boards as a passenger (seat 1); full ahead takes the boat out over the basin towards the ship's hull, the tiller right turns it to starboard, and both ride along; bob jumps out into the water (on foot again, swimming), alice presses E and is out too",
 "levels": ["go", "e2e"],
